{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmesFHTBekC3CmMaZ6zD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JDa2K7ayPFgRAmQ4xTodDb","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"answer":"A פיקדון means you lock your money in the bank for a set time and they pay you interest. The example says 1.8% a year, and if you take the money out early the bank can fine you, sometimes taking all the interest and even some of what you put in. Going by the page's own example it looks like you end up with less than you put in, so I'm not running to open one. I don't really get why that happens.","confidence":"unsure","gave_up":false,"stuck":[{"where":"Calculator box at the top, 'מה קורה לכסף לאורך הזמן'","why":"The big number 68,270 ₪ stuck with me as 'what I get'. Then on the next screen I saw 'ההפקדות שלכם 70,000 ₪' right under 'נשאר לכם 68,270 ₪'. So I put in more than I end up with? I don't get why. Maybe it's the 'בכסף של היום' button or the 2% 'אינפלציה בשנה' box, but nobody told me that in plain words."},{"where":"Calculator fields","why":"It already had 10,000 + 500 a month for 10 years filled in. My 30,000 isn't there, and I didn't want to mess with the slider on my phone."},{"where":"Red box 'שבירת פיקדון לפני הזמן'","why":"This is exactly what I wanted to know (what happens if I take the money out early), and it says 'האתר לא מחשב אותה' and 'שאלה פתוחה'. So I don't get a number for what it costs me."},{"where":"Glossary table at the bottom","why":"A long table that just keeps going. I got bored, only caught 'קנס שבירה' and 'תחנת יציאה'."}],"used":["Heading 'פיקדון' and the first line 'כסף שמפקידים בבנק לתקופה מוסכמת, ובתמורה הבנק משלם עליו ריבית'","Calculator: 68,270 ₪, 'בריבית של 1.8%', '10 שנים'","Summary lines: 'נשאר לכם 68,270', 'מס 986.20', 'ההפקדות שלכם 70,000'","'למה משתמשים בזה': money you know when you'll need, interest with no ups and downs","'כסף נכנס ויוצא': 'משיכה בסוף התקופה שנקבעה בהסכם'","'כמה זה עולה': 'דמי יציאה כשמושכים, לפי התעריף של הגורם המציע'","Tax cards: 'מס על הריבית בסוף כל פיקדון', 15%","Red box about breaking a deposit early","'אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות'","Glossary: 'קנס שבירה', 'תחנת יציאה', 'ריבית קבועה'"],"skimmed":["Second paragraph in 'מה זה' about index-linked (צמוד) and the 8 deposit types","The 'שווה לדעת' list","'מי מציע ומי מפקח'","The long paragraph about פטור למעוט הכנסה and 69,840 ₪","The rest of the glossary"],"skipped":["Small grey text under the calculator fields (date, the 'גיל' field)","'תנאי המוצר בדוגמה'","The 'הצגה כטבלה' fold","The 'הצגת החוקים והכללים' links","Tags like TXI-03, BANK-06","'הצגת כל הבדיקות'","Footer"],"unsure_meaning":["בכסף של היום / בשקלים של העתיד","צמוד למדד / לא צמוד","הבטחת קרן","חשבון במערכת סגורה","מק\"מ","ריבית הפריים","Why 'נשאר לכם' 68,270 is less than 'ההפקדות שלכם' 70,000","Whether 1.8% is what the bank actually pays today or just an example number","The purple 'מחושב' tag"],"not_found":["What breaking the deposit early actually costs, in shekels","An example with my 30,000","A simple answer to whether a deposit is better than leaving the money in the עו\"ש","Which bank pays the most today"],"findings":[{"what":"The first big number (68,270 ₪) looks like a gain, but on the next screen it turns out to be less than what you deposited (70,000). Nothing says plainly that you lose purchasing power, or why.","where":"Calculator 'מה קורה לכסף לאורך הזמן', screens 1–2"},{"what":"What breaking a deposit early costs, which is the main thing you give up, isn't calculated. It's a red 'שאלה פתוחה' box.","where":"Red box in the 'מיסוי' section"},{"what":"The example is fixed at 10,000 + 500 a month for 10 years, not a one-off amount for a short period like a normal deposit","where":"Calculator"},{"what":"A scary line, 'אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות … לא זכות', without telling me whether I should actually worry","where":"'סיכונים ומה לא מוגן'"},{"what":"The page is long, and the glossary at the end takes up three scre